.TH VM-BINDCORE 1 "April 2026" "vm-bindcore 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vm-bindcore \- VM vCPU CPU-Pinning Management Tool (NUMA-aware)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vm-bindcore
[\fB\-v\fR]
\fIcommand\fR
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vm-bindcore
is a NUMA-aware vCPU pinning management tool for KVM/libvirt virtual machines.
It provides automatic and manual vCPU-to-pCPU pinning with strategies:
numa-aware, spread, and compact.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B topology
Show host NUMA topology information.
.TP
.B pin
Pin vCPUs to physical CPUs using a strategy or manual mapping.
.TP
.B unpin
Remove vCPU pinning for a virtual machine.
.TP
.B show
Show current vCPU pinning status for a virtual machine.
.TP
.B restore
Restore pinning from saved persistent configurations.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose output.
.SH PIN OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-vm\fR \fIname\fR
VM domain name (required).
.TP
\fB\-\-strategy\fR numa-aware|spread|compact
Pinning strategy to use.
.TP
\fB\-\-node\fR \fIid\fR
Preferred NUMA node (for numa-aware strategy).
.TP
\fB\-\-manual\fR \fImapping\fR
Manual mapping, e.g., vcpu0:0-3,vcpu1:4-7.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Show NUMA topology:
.RS
.nf
vm-bindcore topology
vm-bindcore topology --format json
.fi
.RE
.PP
Pin with NUMA-aware strategy:
.RS
.nf
vm-bindcore pin --vm test-vm --strategy numa-aware
vm-bindcore pin --vm test-vm --strategy numa-aware --node 0
.fi
.RE
.PP
Manual pinning:
.RS
.nf
vm-bindcore pin --vm test-vm --manual vcpu0:0-3,vcpu1:4-7
.fi
.RE
.PP
Show pinning status:
.RS
.nf
vm-bindcore show --vm test-vm
.fi
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
/etc/vm-bindcore/pinning.d/*.json
Persistent pinning configuration files.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR virsh (1),
.BR numactl (8),
.BR taskset (1)
